@startuml
title UML sequence behaviour — Abort a request after 10 seconds and treat it as a network error
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #344054
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #344054
  FontColor #101828
}
skinparam package {
  BorderColor #667085
  FontColor #101828
  BackgroundColor #F9FAFB
}
box "Frontend — Angular SPA (state and API client)" #E0F2FE
  participant "TodoStore" as store
  participant "HttpTodoApi" as api
end box
box "Backend — Laravel API (HTTP layer)" #D1FADF
  participant "TodoController" as controller
end box
store -> api : Any call (list, create, update, delete, restore, clearCompleted, restoreMany)
api -> api : Pipe the request through timeout(10_000) (L2-042)
api -> controller : HTTP request
note over controller
  No response arrives.
end note
api -> api : Timer expires after 10 seconds
api -> controller : Abort the request (L2-042)
api -> api : Convert the failure to ApiError with kind network (L2-042)
alt the call was GET /api/v1/todos
  api -> api : retry operator waits 300 ms then 900 ms (L2-042)
  api --> store : Task list, or failure after 2 retries
else the call was a write
  api --> store : Failure with no retry (L2-042)
  store -> store : Roll back inside the write method per L2-004, L2-010, L2-013, or L2-015
end
@enduml
